  "releaseNotes": "- Fixed: DisposeAsync() of DialogControllerProvider would error on \n              page refresh / tab close\n            - Fixed: BlazorVmDialogController/IVmDialogController were registered as \n              singletons, causing issues with shared state between tabs in Blazor server\n            - Fixed: Dialogs with AllowCancel=false could still be closed by hitting escape twice\n              (from the internal `OnDocumentKeyDownEscape` method)",
